      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was influenced by tc_attached_snk_entry(). Before starting PE charge manager is informed about port type depending on pd_is_port_partner_dualrole(), but I forgot to check when PE_FLAGS_PORT_PARTNER_IS_DUALROLE is set. It turns out that it is set in pe_snk_evaluate_capability_entry(). In our case, we never entered PE_SNK_Evaluate_Capability, so setting this here doesn\u0027t make sense. I will remove it in next patchset.\n\nThis brings us another question. Do we need to configure this port as CAP_DEDICATED in pe_snk_hard_reset_entry() before going to PE_SRC_Disabled? In my opinion port was configured as CAP_DEDICATED in tc_attached_snk_entry().",
